     "steps": [
      "A man and his wife are 96 years together. He is 6 years older.",
      "Let the wife's age be y. The man is y + 6.",
      "y + (y + 6) = 96, so 2y + 6 = 96.",
      "2y = 90, so y = 45.",
      "The wife is 45 years old. Check: 45 + 51 = 96."
     ],
     "ref": "Example 6",
     "id": "g7.maths.u3.s3-4.12"
