    {
     "kind": "steps",
     "step": "method",
     "title": "Example 7 (sheep and hens)",
     "steps": [
      "Let x be the number of sheep. Hens: 100 − x.",
      "Legs: 4x + 2(100 − x) = 356.",
      "Remove the bracket: 4x + 200 − 2x = 356.",
      "2x = 356 − 200 = 156, so x = 78.",
      "Sheep: 78. Hens: 100 − 78 = 22. Check: 312 + 44 = 356."
     ],
     "ref": "Example 7",
